%div.big-notice
  %h4
    Nitrous Lite is no more
    
  %p
    We launched a new and improved version of Nitrous called
    %a(href='https://pro.nitrous.io') Nitrous Pro
    and are no longer taking new registrations on Nitrous Lite.

  %p
    Nitrous Pro also has a free tier and you will be up and running with your
    workshop, online tutorial, or new project in seconds.  We have support for
    all of your favorite stacks including Ruby on Rails, Meteor, PHP, Go,
    Python, and more.

  %p
    Nitrous Pro comes with root access, runs on your own dedicated cloud
    machine, and has a new and improved web IDE, desktop sync application, and
    live collaboration features.
  
  = link_to 'Get started on Nitrous Pro', 'https://pro.nitrous.io', class: 'btn btn-success nitrous-pro-btn'
